      argument: "AI exposure often transforms tasks rather than eliminating an entire occupation. The entry-level risk is that the old apprenticeship—cleaning, drafting, testing, answering—gets automated before a new apprenticeship is designed. Juniors need access to context and review, not only an AI tool and a target.",
